From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:49:02 +0000
Subject: build(ohos): set the HAR release version

Pins the @kuikly-open/render HAR version to the Raft release coordinate
(<KUIKLY_RELEASE_SET>-2.0.21-ohos) so the hvigor-built HAR carries the
same version the release contract publishes. Only this line changes on a
release-set bump, together with KUIKLY_RELEASE_SET in the patches repo.

Fork-Patch: build-ohos-har-release-version
Origin: b2596240 10dbe916
Upstream-Status: not-upstreamable
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

diff --git a/core-render-ohos/oh-package.json5 b/core-render-ohos/oh-package.json5
index 0ca89c32871e23439b0a49eded1c5e8135db20cd..28ff1a120c39b2c608384d62b379075d3c997409 100644
--- a/core-render-ohos/oh-package.json5
+++ b/core-render-ohos/oh-package.json5
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 {
   "name": "@kuikly-open/render",
-  "version": "2.0.0",
+  "version": "2.28.0-raft.7-2.0.21-ohos",
   "description": "Kuikly is a comprehensive cross-platform solution for UI and logic based on Kotlin multi-platform. It was launched by Tencent's company-level Oteam in the front-end field. It aims to provide a high-performance, full-platform development framework with unified codebase, ultimate ease of use, and dynamic flexibility",
   "main": "Index.ets",
